	(text "C500 is the 680 uF bulk capacitor on CORE1V0. The surrounding 4.7 uF and 470\nnF banks provide distributed bypass for the VCCINT supply balls. The VCCBRAM\ngroup includes the 100 uF C536 and its local 470 nF capacitors. The drawing\ngroups these parts electrically; their final positions must follow the package\nsupply balls."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
